description_block:
Paul Sheldon, Duncan Rabagliati, and other authors: A Record of Grand Prix and Voiturette Racing, Volumes 1 to 15;
published by St Leonards Press, a complete run, Volumes 1 and 2 in black leather bindings and remaining Volumes in black cloth bindings, some 1st and 2nd editions and many limited editions of 500, 300, 70, or 50, some signed by at least one author; a comprehensive racing record covering the period 1900 to 2008, (Volume 1 with covers detached but present). 
(15)

A quantity of sales brochures and literature for commercial vehicles and trucks,
majority post-War and later but some pre-War, sales brochures and sales sheets for vans, trucks, passenger vehicles and caravans, by various manufacturers, including AEC Matador and Mercury;

 Atkinson Gold Knight; 

Austin Gypsy Fire Pump, and 4x4; 

Commer Gown and High Top Vans, Walk-Thru Range, 1100 Light Vans, and a Worshop Manual for 4.108 Deisel Engines; 

DAF Fourgonnette Pick-Up, 1800, 2100, 2200, 2600, and 2800 trucks; 

Dennis Stork, DB Series PAX II, Paravans, and Condor CV chassis, and Javelin; 

Dodge Spacevan; 

ERF Models 44SG, LK and LKG 44, and M Series, 

Foden Champion, Haulmaster, 2000 Series, Fleetmaster, Snowploughs, Alpha XL Cab; 

Ford 1928 Ford Enclosed Drive 30cwt Truck, FK 1000, Transit Bus, A-Series, D-Series, K-Series, Transit and Transit Caravan;

 Ford Thames 30cwt, 2 & 3 Ton Commercial Vehicles, 12-Seater, Traders Series, 10/12 & 15cwt range, 800 range, and Kennebus; 

Guy Big J4t, Big J6, Big J8, Formidable 2-axle tractor chassis; 

Karrier Gamecock, Bantam; 

Leyland pre-War Comet, and sales sheets for Badger, Beaver, Bison, Cub, Terrier, and post-War and later truck models for FG, T45, Constructor, and Roadtrain, Boxer, L12 Buffalo, Cruiser, Mastiff, Reiver, Super 'G' Cab, Super Comet; 

Morris FG Series, and Vans and Pick-Ups; Morris-Commercial Equi-Load; 

Scammell Super 6 x 6 Constructor, Sherpa 4 x 2 Dump Truck, Routeman Mk II, Nubian; 

Scania Class D; 

Seddon Atkinson 200, 201, 300 and 400 series, Multi-Wheelers, and Strato; 

Spurlings Transit Ambulance; 

 Thornycroft Big Ben; 

Volvo L395,F6, FL7 & FL10, F85, and FM; and others;

 together with assorted sales brochures for caravans and motorhomes including Auto-Sleeper, Bedford Autosleeper, Dormobile Freeway, Commer Adventurer, Leyland ci Highwayman, Toyota Rio, Danbury, Bluebird MotoPlus, Winnebago Chieftain and Journey, Landliner, Daihatsu, Martin Walter Ltd Dormobile, Newlander Mk/II, VW Microbus, Ford Cotswold, Hadrian, Thomson T-Line, Romahome, Viking & Pioneer Spacemaker, and others.
